{"speciesId":247,"names":{"fr":"Ymphect","es":"Pupitar","en":"Pupitar","ja":"サナギラス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its THRASHING can topple a mountain."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has out­ standing destruc­ tive power."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It will not stay still, even while it's a pupa. It already has arms and legs under its solid shell."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable - it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable - it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it ejects under compression to propel itself like a jet. Its body can withstand a collision with solid steel."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its THRASHING can topple a mountain."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est dur comme la pierre souterraine. Il file comme une fusée en expulsant des gaz."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est dur comme la pierre souterraine. Il file comme une fusée en expulsant des gaz."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps est dur comme la pierre souterraine. Il file comme une fusée en expulsant des gaz."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo es duro como la roca. Se autopropulsa como un cohete soltando los gases de su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"岩盤のような 硬い 体。 圧縮した ガスを 噴射して まるで ロケットのように 飛び出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa carapace est aussi dure que la pierre et il est très fort. Ses coups peuvent raser une montagne."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su caparazón es duro como una piedra y muy resistente. Su Golpe puede derribar montañas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"岩盤のような 硬い 殻に 覆われているが 力は 強く 暴れると 山も 崩れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ymphect crée un gaz dans son corps qu’il comprime puissamment pour se propulser, comme un avion à réaction. Son corps est très solide. Il ne l’endommage pas, même lorsqu’il frappe de l’acier trempé."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pupitar crea un gas en su interior que comprime y expulsa violentamente a modo de autopropulsión. Tiene un cuerpo resistente que se mantiene inalterable hasta cuando se golpea contra duro acero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pupitar creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable—it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体内で つくりだした ガスを 圧縮して 勢いよく 噴射する ことで 飛んでいく。 鋼鉄に ぶつかっても 平気な ボディだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ymphect crée un gaz dans son corps qu’il comprime puissamment pour se propulser, comme un avion à réaction. Son corps est très solide. Il ne l’endommage pas, même lorsqu’il frappe de l’acier trempé."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pupitar crea un gas en su interior que comprime y expulsa violentamente a modo de autopropulsión. Tiene un cuerpo resistente que se mantiene inalterable hasta cuando se golpea contra duro acero."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pupitar creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable—it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体内で つくりだした ガスを 圧縮して 勢いよく 噴射する ことで 飛んでいく。 鋼鉄に ぶつかっても 平気な ボディだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Impatient d’évoluer, il évacue son stress en libérant des gaz sous haute pression qui le font bondir dans tous les sens. Une vraie plaie !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon está impaciente por evolucionar y libera tensiones expulsando gas comprimido con el que se propulsa. Un verdadero incordio."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This troublesome Pokémon can’t wait to evolve, so it relieves its stress by wildly propelling itself around using compressed gas."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"進化を 待てず 圧縮ガスで 飛びまわり 暴れて ストレスを 解消する 迷惑な ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cette chrysalide est très dangereuse. À l’intérieur de cette carapace solide comme le roc, son nouveau corps se développe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Posee un enorme poder destructivo. Dentro de su caparazón duro como la roca, su cuerpo experimenta una metamorfosis."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This dangerous pupa thrashes about. Its shell is as hard as bedrock, containing its gradually forming new body within."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"暴れまわる 危険な サナギ。 岩盤の ような カラの 中では 次の 身体が できあがりつつある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut se déplacer même s’il est coincé dans sa coquille. Sa robustesse et sa vitesse lui confèrent un terrible pouvoir de destruction."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se mueve libremente aun encerrado en la coraza. Su enorme poder destructivo se une a su dureza y rapidez."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"殻に 被われているが 自由に 飛びまわれる。 硬さと 速さを もつので 破壊力 抜群だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Malgré son état de chrysalide, il ne reste pas immobile. Sous sa solide carapace, ses pattes sortent déjà."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"No se está quieto ni aun siendo una pupa. Sus extremidades ya se han formado bajo su robusta coraza."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It will not stay still, even while it’s a pupa. It already has arms and legs under its solid shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"さなぎだが じっと していない。 頑丈な 殻の 下では すでに 手足が できている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":247,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[3,"level-up",29],[4,"level-up",29],[5,"level-up",29],[6,"level-up",29],[7,"level-up",29],[8,"level-up",23],[9,"level-up",23],[10,"level-up",23],[11,"level-up",28],[12,"level-up",29],[13,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",28],[15,"level-up",28],[16,"level-up",28],[17,"level-up",28],[18,"level-up",28],[20,"level-up",42],[23,"level-up",42],[25,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",9],[23,"level-up",9],[25,"level-up",9]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[3,"level-up",65],[3,"machine",0],[4,"level-up",65],[4,"machine",0],[5,"level-up",65],[5,"machine",0],[6,"level-up",65],[6,"machine",0],[7,"level-up",65],[7,"machine",0],[8,"level-up",60],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",60],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",60],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",67],[11,"machine",0],[12,"l